Package: cgjrapp
Title: Country Jobs and Growth Report Institutional Dashboard
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("World Bank PIDA Data Science Shop", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pida@worldbank.org")
Description: A Shiny dashboard for the institutional chapter of the Country
    Jobs and Growth Report (CGJR). It benchmarks a country, region or income
    group against a chosen comparison group across the CGJR governance
    taxonomy, computing Closeness-to-Frontier composites live per selection
    from the tidy tibbles shipped by the 'cgjrdata' package. An AI report
    and chat, guided by the CGJR guidance note, cite and verify their sources.
